  "body": "I am asking this question here, because it is not a browser specific issue and I don't think it is a good fit for Stack Overflow, because I am asking about a use-case and whether something is or will be a part of the standard, not a specific coding question.\r\n\r\nIs it, with the current spec, or will it be possible in the future versions of the spec, to have a web bluetooth page which is not only able to connect to a Bluetooth device, but also accept a connection from a Bluetooth device or another web page?\r\n\r\nI am not that familiar with Bluetooth, so this may not be even technically possible, but I am wondering whether this use case is or will be supported, as it would have huge implications for mesh networking which is my area of interest.\r\n\r\nThank you",
